WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.872
Browse the feed. Text posts, photos, and articles appear together.

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:10.128
Read a blog post. Open an article to read the full text on its own page.

00:00:10.128 --> 00:00:13.259
Manage your site. Sign in to edit posts, change settings, or create a post.

00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:20.618
Write a post. Choose a format, add text or media, then publish.

00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:23.645
Publish and share. The published post has a URL you can share.

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:26.854
See the new post. New posts appear at the top of your website’s feed.
